            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Cong Vien Nho",
            "review_text": "Missy_NZ\nHanoi, Vietnam30 contributions\n0\nGroup booking let down\nDec 2014 • Business\nWe had a recent group celebration at this restaurant with approx 80 people. The restaurant isn't heated so the place was freezing and we all ate in our jackets. The set menu seemed like good value when we booked but was quite disappointing.The food (set menu) was nothing special at all and came out very slowly. We had a kids table set up but all the kids had left the table by the last the last dishes were coming out, we simply couldn't insist they sit waiting any longer. The setting is lovely and I imagine it would be very nice on a sunny day. There was an issue at the end of the meal as they were insisting we pay in cash - quite difficult when you are paying for a large group. This was resolved in the end. Probably wouldn't return.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 18, 2014",
